guide point network_0_start  up from arch.r2.e5 left and even with arch.r2.e5 top
guide point network_0_end  down from arch.r2.e5 right and even with arch.r2.e5 bottom
region network_0 "⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ingress network" (inside top, align: left)  network_0_start to network_0_end  padding: 2  style: network_0  depth: behind arch
guide point network_0_icon_corner  1.6 below network_0 top-left
guide point network_0_icon_place  2 right of network_0_icon_corner
node network_0_icon ""  icon: network  on network_0_icon_place
guide point network_1_start  up from arch.r4.strip.l0 left and even with 0.5 above arch.r4.e0 top
guide point network_1_end  down from arch.r3.e3 right and even with arch.r1.e6 bottom
region network_1 "⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀platform network" (inside top, align: left)  network_1_start to network_1_end  padding: 3  style: network_1  depth: behind arch
guide point network_1_icon_corner  1.6 below network_1 top-left
guide point network_1_icon_place  2 right of network_1_icon_corner
node network_1_icon ""  icon: network  on network_1_icon_place

